OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start with the odd mist
OL,6,Fpatch in rural areas, but these will
OL,7,Fquickly clear. Otherwise a dry and
OL,8,Fsunny day across the region with just
OL,9,Fsome fair weather cloud developing.
OL,10,FFeeling very warm with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and fine evening with
OL,13,Fplenty of late sunshine. Overnight
OL,14,Fwill remain dry with clear spells, but
OL,15,Ffeeling a little warmer than recent
OL,16,Fnights.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FAnother fine and dry day with
OL,19,Fplenty of sunshine across the West
OL,20,FMidlands. Feeling hot in the sunshine
OL,21,Fand light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
