OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Flittle more cloud in the sky on
OL,7,FMonday, before the sunny weather
OL,8,Freturns on Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,9,FTemperatures briefly dip on Monday
OL,10,Fbefore becoming hot once again by
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
